  - line: 24
    type: narration
    text: "focus: Over millennia, the Sage trains generations of mages in his hidden sanctuary while Torrhen's presence persists as an eternal current in the quantum foam; the Sage senses the gathering convergence for the future return to transform tyranny."
  - line: 25
    type: narration
    text: "continuity: Summary montage spanning millennia after scene 019.3; later chapters may return to earlier points within this broad post-flood span"
  - line: 26
    type: narration
